+      <t indent="0" pn="section-1-7">The first understandings to be conveyed are those regarding the
 responsibilities for administration of the various zones within the
 &quot;e164.arpa&quot; domain:</t>
-      <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-1-10">
